          "reason": "官方模块页正文可核（快照正文位于单行 HTML，按行截断读取只显示导航；以下引句均可全文检索）：AI Discovery 页：“Scan AWS, Azure, GCP, VMs, containers, and APIs for AI assets.”、“Surface unofficial models, agents, and API integrations.”、“Automatically associate AI assets with owners, business units, sensitivity, and risk levels.”、“A living, always-current map of all AI activity in the enterprise, continuously refreshed.”、“Align AI assets with NIST, OWASP, and ATLAS frameworks.”，并说明自动扫描云账户、仓库、端点与流水线：“Scan cloud accounts, repos, endpoints, and pipelines to detect every model and associated agent.”；AI Attack Simulation 页：“Test for jailbreaks, injection, role confusion, and harmful response patterns.”、“Probe for extraction of PHI, PII, or proprietary data.”、“Simulate unauthorized actions through agent tools and APIs.”、“Get actionable fixes for each finding.”；AI Runtime Security 页：“Detect and investigate prompt injection, unsafe agent behavior, sensitive data exposure, malicious tool use, and other runtime threats.”、“Detect, block, or redact unsafe actions and sensitive information according to policy and platform capabilities.”、“Integrate runtime detections and enforcement events with existing SIEM, SOAR, and security operations workflows.”。官方 insight 正文进一步把流程概括为 “detection → evidence → action”，说明 findings 需 understood/validated/prioritized/remediated，并称证据化检测可加速 triage、使 remediation 更精确。条目据此限定在 AI 资产清单（shadow AI/归属/持续更新）、AI 专项红队评估、逐条 finding 修复建议、运行时检测/调查与 inline 阻断/脱敏、SIEM/SOAR 交接及 findings 验证—优先级—修复路径；不声称具体工单系统或完整分诊平台 UI。",
